# .requirements â€” PolyCal requirement traceability log
#
# Full workflow: docs/REQUIREMENTS-WORKFLOW.md
#
# PURPOSE
#   Append-only audit trail linking implemented work to Jira (PC-xxx) and git commits.
#   Jira holds planned work; this file records what was delivered and where.
#
# FORMAT (pipe-delimited, one requirement per line)
#   YYYY-MM-DD | <commit-sha> | PC-<n> | <requirement summary> | <primary module path>
#
# RULES
#   - Do not edit or delete completed rows.
#   - Every commit on feature/* branches MUST include a Jira key (PC-123) in the message.
#   - Rows are appended automatically by scripts/append-requirement.ts after each commit.
#   - If .requirements changes after a commit, include it in your next commit or amend.
#
# EXAMPLE
#   2026-06-18 | a1b2c3d | PC-42 | Add weekly calendar view | src/app/calendar/page.tsx
#
